; remarks.vla - the proctor's remarks: the Remarks sheet, a remark a row, a row's place
; its grade, A, B, C, D and F, the grade a report card gives the firm against the market
; (docs/OMAKASE.md, CRITIC.1). Words alone: one macro named after this file, whose body is
; one call of the library's strings. The source includes this file after its manifest,
; with every other include, and calls (remarks) where the sheet's rows belong. The Report
; shows the remark of the card's grade, the quarter's at the first three cards of a year
; and the year's at the fourth, so the first five rows are the grades', A first, and a
; row past them is never shown. The proctor who administers every exam grades the cards
; too, and has not been promoted. To change a remark, read README.md beside this file.

(defmacro (remarks)
  "the proctor's remarks: the Remarks sheet, a remark a row, a row's place its grade"
  (strings "Remarks"                ; the sheet, hidden among the tabs
    ("Remark" 100)                  ; its field, its header and its width in characters
    ; each row: the remark on a grade, A's first, then B's, C's, D's and F's
    ("Well ahead of the market. The proctor has referred your file to Compliance, as a formality.")
    ("Ahead of the market. The proctor notes that legends and cautionary tales both start this way.")
    ("In line with the market, which Average Co. also managed, unattended.")
    ("Behind the market. The proctor reminds you that Average Co. was available the whole time.")
    ("Well behind the market. The proctor has left a pamphlet on index funds in your tray.")
    ))                              ; the sheet's end: the five grades' remarks stand above this line
